  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "網路貿易與跨境電商",
    "sub_ename": "ONLINE TRADE AND CROSS-BORDER E-COMMERCE",
    "describe_ch": "探討網路貿易與多平台跨境電商的營運狀況，並以國際貿易專業知識為基礎，從商流、金流、物流等方面，引導學生逐步了解跨境電商理論架構,期使學生更深一層了解「互聯網」時代下國際貿易的實務運作及流程。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is mainly to explore the operation status of online trade and multi-platform cross-border e-commerce. Based on international trade expertise, to guide students to gradually understand the theoretical framework of cross-border e-commerce from the aspects of business flow, cash flow, and logistics flow, etc. A deeper understanding of the practical operation and process of international trade under the \"Internet\" era.",
